            -75.118851,39.946175,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Cooper Medical School at Rowan University</name>
        <description>CMSRU's six story Medical Education Building features 200,000 square feet of learning spaces, administrative offices and research facilities. Inside the building are 27 Active Learning Rooms, several floors of research and teaching labs, to be used by both students and faculty, an auditorium seating 250 people, a large multipurpose room seating 140, a multipurpose Teaching Laboratory seating 120, Wellness Facilities, a Learning Commons and satellite Medical Library where students can meet in a casual and comfortable setting with CMSRU's faculty and each other. A Clinical Simulation Center is also in this facility, providing students with space to learn interviewing and clinical skills. Medical school administrative offices, including the dean's office, student services and financial aid are here as well.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Keywords: cooper, medical school, science, med school, medicine&lt;br&gt;Categories: Academic Buildings&lt;br&gt;Location: 39.940453, -75.119698</description>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Keywords">
            <value>cooper, medical school, science, med school, medicine</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Categories">
            <value>Academic Buildings</value>
